      "message": "So as previously discussed, in this v3 sql method, the service will still be included even with no endpoints (unlike the v2 or generic v3 methods).  I think this is actually a bug - the catalog is not a generalised service discovery mechanism, it\u0027s an \"endpoints that are accessible for the scope of my token\" discovery mechanism. So I think you should:\n\n 1) Change this comment to remove the bit about the service\n 2) Raise a separate bug saying that in circumstances that there are no valid endpoints, the service should also not be enumerated (this will let others debate this point separately)\n 3) Add a separate TODO comment in the make_v3_service method below saying that a bug has been raised about this",
